\newlabel{tab:fam}{{1}{7}{Baseline model (ER-trained, linear read-out, $n=20$) evaluated on each family. ``typ.\ diameter / gap'' is the median diameter / spectral gap of graphs in that family; ``exact match'' is the fraction of graphs predicted entirely correctly, averaged over the $8$ training seeds; ``seed sd'' is the standard deviation of that fraction across the $8$ seeds. Rows sorted by gap}{table.caption.7}{}}
